You need at least 15 power points. Then collect all stones and use it
to prepare meat balls.
And use boulders to prepare a feast that is not good for the dexterity,
but you are not trying
to kill anyway. The meat balls are good for taming dogs, cats and the
starting apples are
good for taming ponies.

